---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Medical Disclaimer"
  description="Medical disclaimer for InfluenzaSymptoms.com. This site provides educational health information only — not medical advice."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 prose">
    <h1>Medical Disclaimer</h1>

    <div class="callout-emergency">
      <strong>If you are experiencing a medical emergency, call 911 (United States) or 112 (European Union) immediately.</strong>
    </div>

    <h2>No Medical Advice</h2>
    <p>
      The information provided on InfluenzaSymptoms.com is for <strong>general informational and educational purposes only</strong>
      and is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
    </p>
    <p>
      Always seek the advice of your physician or other qualified health provider with any questions
      you may have regarding a medical condition. Never disregard professional medical advice or delay
      in seeking it because of something you have read on this website.
    </p>

    <h2>No Doctor-Patient Relationship</h2>
    <p>
      Use of this website does <strong>not</strong> create a doctor-patient relationship. Information
      provided on this site does not constitute medical consultation, diagnosis, or treatment recommendations
      for any specific individual.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy and Currency</h2>
    <p>
      While we strive to provide accurate and up-to-date information, medical knowledge is constantly evolving.
      We cannot guarantee that all information on this site is complete, current, or error-free.
      Content is reviewed regularly, and last-reviewed dates are displayed on each page.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, InfluenzaSymptoms.com and its authors shall not
      be liable for any damages arising from the use of, or inability to use, the information on this website.
      This includes, without limitation, direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.
    </p>

    <h2>External Links</h2>
    <p>
      This site may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the content,
      accuracy, or practices of any third-party sites.
    </p>

    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-8">
      Last updated: July 2026
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
